# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# No SPA catch-all here: without a top-level 404.html, Cloudflare Pages already
# serves index.html for any path that has no file, so React Router handles it.
# A "/* /index.html 200" rule would also override the prerendered content pages
# (e.g. /iso-27001/annex-a/*.html) that scripts/prerender.mjs writes at build time.
